  "instructions": [
    "In a large pan, heat 2 tablespoons of oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the grated ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Stir in the garam masala, cumin, cayenne pepper, and salt, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chickpeas, water, and sour cream, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Serve the chana masala hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
